    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Exported Candidates Overview  - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-exported-candidates-overview----crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "LinkedIn allows the ability for customers to export limited LinkedIn profile information from LinkedIn Recruiter into their Talent CRM with a single click. This integration between LinkedIn Recruiter and the partner Talent CRM will improve workflow improvements for our customers.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Exported Candidates Overview  - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-exported-candidates-overview----crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Exported Candidates Overview  - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-exported-candidates-overview----crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The call volume limit for the Recruiter One-Click Export API is 300 per Recruiter seat per month",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Exported Candidates Overview  - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-exported-candidates-overview----crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Note",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieve Exported Candidates Overview  - CRM Connect",
      "Anchor": "retrieve-exported-candidates-overview----crm-connect",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The latest API version is 202604. Use this version in the LinkedIn-Version header for all API requests to access the most recent features and improvements.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Authentication",
      "Anchor": "authentication",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Before you get started...",
        "Authentication"
      ],
      "Text": "All API requests should be authorized with a OAuth 2.0 Client Credentials token.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Syncing all pipelines",
      "Anchor": "syncing-all-pipelines",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Before you get started...",
        "Syncing all pipelines"
      ],
      "Text": "For the Recruiter to associate a candidate with an appropriate pipeline, you must sync all of your customer\u0027s pipelines with LinkedIn. Learn more about syncing pipelines here .",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Push Notification Platform",
      "Anchor": "push-notification-platform",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Before you get started...",
        "Push Notification Platform"
      ],
      "Text": "For customer export requests to be in real-time from LinkedIn, LinkedIn will be pushing notifications of export events to our partners. Read more about LinkedIn\u0027s push notification platform.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Receiving Push Notifications",
      "Anchor": "receiving-push-notifications",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Exported Candidates",
        "Receiving Push Notifications"
      ],
      "Text": "When an export event occurs within LinkedIn, a push notification will be sent to the registered callback URL for your customer. Each event will have an event-type of \u0022EXPORT_CANDIDATE_PROFILE\u0022.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieving Exported Candidate Information",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-exported-candidate-information",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Exported Candidates",
        "Retrieving Exported Candidate Information"
      ],
      "Text": "When the callback URL has received a notification event of \u0022EXPORT_CANDIDATE_PROFILE\u0022 type, you should then make an API call to retrieve the limited profile information of the exported candidate.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Retrieving Exported Candidate Information",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-exported-candidate-information",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Exported Candidates",
        "Retrieving Exported Candidate Information"
      ],
      "Text": "Included in the response will be the integrationContext field. This field will contain an identifier unique to the customer for which this candidate was exported on behalf of. Since all callback URLs are unique per customer, you should verify that this identifier correlates to the callback URL the request was sent to.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Retrieving Exported Candidate Information",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-exported-candidate-information",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Exported Candidates",
        "Retrieving Exported Candidate Information"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/v2/exportedCandidates?q=request\u0026requestId=123456789",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Retrieving Exported Candidate Information",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-exported-candidate-information",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Exported Candidates",
        "Retrieving Exported Candidate Information"
      ],
      "Text": "GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/exportedCandidates?q=request\u0026requestId=123456789",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
