      "Section": "Retrieving Closed Candidate Profiles",
      "Anchor": "retrieving-closed-candidate-profiles",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Retrieving Closed Candidate Profiles"
      ],
      "Text": "If a candidate deletes their LinkedIn account, they can reactivate it within 21 days. After 21 days, we purge the deleted accounts and populate that information within the Closed Candidates Endpoint. Our CRM partners must query this endpoint periodically (at least once in 30 days) and notify end customers that they may need to delete the data that appear within this endpoint from their records if they do not have a legal basis to continue processing it.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
